  ],
  "prov:wasGeneratedBy": [
    "Benchmark entries were generated through a rule-guided workflow that combines source-document review, dataset directory scanning, task synthesis, dataset-specific kernel coding, machine-checkable validation, and community review.",
    "The review-release metadata tables in this Croissant package were exported from local benchmark summary tables after filtering to the 53 completed entries and 245 task definitions used in the paper.",
    "Task documents and kernels are maintained under a shared entry rulebook and revised through NeuroDoc and NeuroAudit workflows when evidence conflicts or executable inconsistencies are identified."
  ]
